/*
 * Version literal validation.
 *
 * VersionLiteralValidation performs semantic validation of version literals
 * used in conditional compilation constructs. A version literal evaluates to a
 * boolean indicating whether a given version identifier is active in the
 * current compilation state.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::literal::version_
